====Furfrou Elite Four====
In {{g|Legends: Z-A}}, the Kalos Elite Four are not present. However, [[Lumiose City]] is host to an unofficial [[Furfrou League]] with its own Elite Four. They can be challenged as part of [[Mission (Legends: Z-A)#Side missions|Side Mission #103: ''Facing the Furfrou League'']]. As part of the challenge, the player is only permitted to have {{p|Furfrou}} in their [[party]], though they may use up to six Furfrou. Despite not being a sanctioned league, each of these Trainers have the Elite Four {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}}.

